{"id":2390,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为传递坚韧不拔的成长力量，激发同学们直面困境的勇气，3月22日早十点，中北大学“一站式”学生社区博雅书院温情开展主题瑜伽活动。此次活动特邀体育学院学生指导，以舒缓身心、锤炼意志为核心，让同学们在一呼一吸、一伸一展间，感受坚持的力量与成长的美好。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bUzUE8ozVfUz-ine7-PLR-snmG4MRGyYUzT7U4n2ozT2Lll0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRMYyDMYhkLzfRUmAfL47DMmN8MzTkLzr2UlV2UzvbnzrFnzLbMNW2M4AFLz9Yn7UJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4LmNsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33297&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EC767B10CB8A31669459B15FAAFA79E5/E396BF78/182DD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bnllEYLmCaozTfoeRLsMmQ2UNn7Um7y8L4-iLmNsL7rkL4v0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhRLkyiokyYMlM2ozl8Mm6RLz7sLm7sL7rVL8CYM7WkU8WFLmfknlV2LzMFUzNYUzlJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4LmNsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33297&e=.png\"></p><p>活动现场，体育学院学生耐心讲解每一个体式的动作要领，引导同学们调整呼吸、放松身心，克服身体的僵硬与疲惫。从基础的拉伸到进阶的体式，同学们认真跟随、坚持不懈，即便身体酸痛也未曾轻言放弃，用行动诠释着“坚韧”二字的深刻内涵，也在专注与坚持中，学会与自己和解，汲取直面困境的勇气与力量。<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bUzWEkMz7bU4n7LeN7ZnRLbnNnkLmny7L4vDLl7ZnRWVoRU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiL1yPn1yYLRG8U8lPUzUPU8rkL4Q2LlUsUl7aLlnVMmTFLR9iLzNbLmWFMmGDnzCJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4LmNsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33297&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7521F2004CE1A41CEB36F1D7AA01DE69/08519922/606E6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 1px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bUzWEkMz7bU4n7LeN7ZnRLbnNnkLmny7L4vDLl7ZnRWVoRU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiL1yPn1yYLRG8U8lPUzUPU8rkL4Q2LlUsUl7aLlnVMmTFLR9iLzNbLmWFMmGDnzCJqjfjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4LmNsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33297&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=boznEkM4NPUNnRUem7Znz9bL7l8MRGyYnlWVU4GYMRLaUmC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hRMkyiUShfolQVoz9aMRNsUmr7MNUZMm-bUmGsU4W2U8VFMmviU4lPnRfFLzARL4UJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4LmNsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33297&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BC45AA9FE980497B5D6D8629B07C2FCA/675C51D0/18C34\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bM8VE2ozNDUNUsMem7anNQRMN7anmUy4LR9bU4NYnmU4LN-0gihFp2hmCIa0MYhkLkhRMkyaLm62Mz7ao7l4MmlaU4CDnNLaM4M7Mmf2UmTFUz-bn7nfM8VFUzNYUzlJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4LmNsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33297&e=.png\"></p><p></p><p>活动尾声，同学们围坐交流体验感悟，分享练习中的收获与成长，言语间满是释然与坚定。这场瑜伽活动不仅舒缓了同学们的学业压力，更让大家在坚持中学会沉淀，在自律中收获成长，成为书院传递坚韧力量、丰富育人场景的又一生动实践。院将以此为首场，于每周日上午10点常态化开展瑜伽系列活动， 持续助力同学们在坚守中成长，在自律中前行，以从容姿态奔赴属于自己的星辰大海。</p><p></p><p>一审一校 郭鹏丽</p><p>二审二校 王熠暄</p><p>三审三校 王慧慧</p><p><br></p></div><BR><BR></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jxdl.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=bUzUE8ozVfUz-ine7-PLR-snmG4MRGyYUzT7U4n2ozT2Lll0gihFp2hmCIa0nShRMYyDMYhkLzfRUmAfL47DMmN8MzTkLzr2UlV2UzvbnzrFnzLbMNW2M4AFLz9Yn7UJv2bjo4OeoDXZ_InOQDL0qIbtpYyPMRLZg4L4LmNsgtA8pUhcc&oid=1069369254&tid=1438&nid=33297&e=.png"}